Throughout this dissertation, each result is explicitly classified:

· Theorem: Established under stated assumptions.
· Conditional Proposition: Established only under additional behavioral or structural assumptions.
· Derivation: Formal computation from defined quantities.
· Conjecture: Plausible but unproven statement.
· Empirical Hypothesis: Falsifiable prediction requiring experimental validation.

